flowchart TB
    KE[KeyEvent] --> IP[InputPipeline]
    IP -->|PipelineResponse| IO[InputOrchestrator]

    %% Exception: bracketed paste is Event::Paste(String), not KeyEvent.
    %% It bypasses this flow and is handled at the UI boundary.
    PASTE[Event::Paste] -.-> UIEX[UI paste exception]

    subgraph IO[InputOrchestrator]
        PR[PipelineResponse]
        CHECK{Is CommandExecute?}
        DIRECT[Use PipelineResponse directly]
        GETCMD[Get command_input from state]
        CP[CommandPipeline.process]
        CR{CommandResponse}
        RESOLVED[ResolvedAction]
        INC[CommandIncomplete]
        UNK[CommandUnknown]
        EXIT[ExitCommandMode]

        PR --> CHECK
        CHECK -->|No| DIRECT
        CHECK -->|Yes| GETCMD
        GETCMD --> CP
        CP --> CR
        CR -->|Execute| RESOLVED
        CR -->|Incomplete| INC
        CR -->|Unknown| UNK
        CR -->|Empty| EXIT
    end

    DIRECT --> AD[ActionDecider]
    RESOLVED --> AD
    INC --> AD
    UNK --> AD
    EXIT --> AD
